# KWallet is switched OFF in Fab OS (docs/decisions/ADR-0015-no-wallet.md): no wallet prompts, no wallet application.
# The keys below are the ones the binaries in the image actually read (checked 2026-09-15: kwalletd6 reads Enabled,
# Close When Idle, Idle Timeout, Launch Manager; libKF6Wallet reads Enabled, Default Wallet, Local Wallet, Use One Wallet).
# With Enabled=false, KWallet::Wallet::isEnabled() is false for every KDE application: plasma-nm then stores Wi-Fi / VPN
# secrets system-wide in NetworkManager (root-only files under /etc/NetworkManager/system-connections), and the Fab OS
# agent keeps its provider keys and mail password in systemd-creds. To use KWallet after all: set Enabled=true in
# ~/.config/kwalletrc and install kwalletmanager.
[Wallet]
Enabled=false
Close When Idle=false
Launch Manager=false
